# ${project_name}

${project_description}

Docusaurus site that aggregates `docs/` from every homelab repo at build
time via the [`docusaurus-plugin-content-docs-remote`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/docusaurus-plugin-content-docs-remote)
plugin (or equivalent). No committed mirror, no sync workflow — source
of truth stays in each originating repo.

## Layout

```
docusaurus.config.js   # site config + remote-content sources
docs/                  # native pages (cross-cutting docs)
src/                   # custom React components / theming
package.json
```

